# Batch files cannot be parsed reliably with LF-only line endings: cmd.exe needs
# CRLF for some label / block forms. core.autocrlf=input normalises to LF in the
# index and leaves LF in the worktree, so this has to be stated explicitly --
# cxx/exec.cmd is currently LF in the index and only survives because an older
# checkout left CRLF on disk.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
